---
import { brand } from '../../data/brand';
import LegalPage from '../../components/LegalPage.astro';
---
<LegalPage title="Terms of sale" description={`Terms of sale for ${brand.name} accessories and digital files.`}>
  <h2>What you buy</h2>
  <p>We sell two kinds of products. <strong>Accessories</strong> are physical goods shipped to your address; shipping cost and estimated delivery time are shown at checkout. <strong>3D print files</strong> (STL files, delivered as a ZIP) are delivered by download link; no physical part is shipped for them.</p>
  <h2>Fitment</h2>
  <p>Each listing says whether it is universal or which vehicles and years it fits. Check dimensions on universal items before you buy.</p>
  <h2>License (3D files)</h2>
  <p>Each file keeps the license of the original design (CC BY, CC BY-SA or CC0), shown on its product page. Our tech sheets and packaging are licensed to you for personal use.</p>
  <h2>Use at your own risk</h2>
  <p>Printed parts are not OEM parts. Do not print safety-critical parts (brakes, steering, seat belts, airbags, fuel system). You are responsible for the material, print quality and installation.</p>
  <h2>Payments</h2>
  <p>Prices are in USD and processed by PayPal. Local taxes (VAT/GST) are added at checkout where required.</p>
</LegalPage>
